lines=['# R06 outcome-specific barrier and response matrix','','29 October 2026. Internal analytical aid, pending independent integrated review. Not a validated taxonomy, causal remedy, required questionnaire or supplier-conversion score. See the [desktop findings](R06-DESKTOP-READOUT.md).','','## Start with four separate facts','','Record the actual option, dated disposition of the specific decision object, implementation and benefit. A retained platform, changed contract route and staged organisational change can coexist. A project can contain successive or different component decisions. Preserve source words, date precision and knowledge; do not infer pending, rejection or no formal approval from silence.','','| Context | What to establish | Possible response, subject to the actual case | Inference to avoid | Evidence |','| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |']
for x in matrix:lines.append('| '+ ' | '.join([x['context'],x['establish'],x['possible_response'],x['inference_limit'],', '.join(x['supporting_claim_ids'])])+' |')
lines+=['','These are optional analysis rows, not a list to read to every contributor. A possible response is not an adopted action or observed effect. No condition is presumed addressable, no remedy is guaranteed and a reasoned stop or continuation can be legitimate.','','## Record the object and chronology','','For a material event retain: case/object/scope; event date and position as of; source/knowledge; original and any supported normalised disposition; selected/retained option; what changed/continued; stated reason; alternatives; remaining condition/owner/review where known; actual action; delivery/benefit; later event and missingness. The [structured map](R06-outcome-map.json) keeps a blank template. No confidential complete committee, budget or contract pack is required.','','A postponed rollout is not automatically deferred investment approval. The West Sussex March/October history is one programme and a later self-service notice is not full payroll assurance. A cancelled NICS payroll component did not erase other functioning components; that 2001 event is historical context outside recent fieldwork. A cancelled NZ advance notice is not an established cancelled tender or upgrade.','','## Keep buyer evidence in its own lane','','A hypothetical trigger, future preference, reviewed arrangement, reported ease and stated premium justification are different measures. They do not establish a funded proposal, actual switch/renewal or causality. Overall survey samples/country counts do not substitute for item-valid bases or UK-specific outcomes. Moorepay numeric conflicts and earlier holds remain.','','Use the existing unaided Q006–Q013 routes and fourteen core questions. Do not demand disclosure, fill unknowns from market anecdotes or force a decline story. Retaining software can coexist with investment in people, process, controls or another service component.','','## Current evidence gaps','','Current private-employer explicit declines and withdrawn proposals, actual internal alternatives and demonstrated remedy effects require original permissioned cases. Published employer contexts are selected secondary evidence for this commission, not any of its six to ten original contributors. No outcome frequency, risk score, price or forecast is supplied. Nothing has been sent.']
(ROOT/'03-report/R06-BARRIER-RESPONSE-MATRIX.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n')
(ROOT/'03-report/modules/R06-staying-switching-delay-and-abandonment.md').write_text('''# R06 Staying, switching, deferral, rejection and abandonment

Desktop synthesis prepared29October2026. Independent integrated review and preservation gate pending. Original practitioner integration and final publication checks remain open.

## Decision this informs

Why a specific payroll-related choice is retained, changed, delayed, declined or stopped, and what response if any fits the actual condition.

## Desktop answer

Establish the actual object, selected/retained option, dated disposition, implementation and benefit separately. A retained platform can coexist with a changed route or organisational scope; approved change can have postponed rollout. Retention can be on merit, constrained or mixed. Component/notice cancellation does not automatically mean abandonment of the whole need. Survey preferences and hypothetical triggers do not supply an actual decision history.

The [readout](../R06-DESKTOP-READOUT.md), [barrier/response matrix](../R06-BARRIER-RESPONSE-MATRIX.md) and [structured event map](../R06-outcome-map.json) organise six selected public employer contexts and one narrow notice-status context. Nine optional matrix rows do not expand the fourteen-question core or prescribe a workflow/score.

## What the research adds

- Product/service/route/organisational boundary and retained work are different objects of retention/change.
- Public approval, contract entry, system use, scoped self-service and benefit require distinct evidence.
- Conditions and alternatives can support reasonable continuity without proving satisfaction, irrationality or permanent lock-in.
- Historical component cancellation, delayed rollout and a cancelled advance notice are different states with different dates/scope.
- Survey intention, routed experience, satisfaction and conditional premium do not establish observed funded choices; item/population limits and conflicts remain.
- Possible response, adopted action and observed result stay separate; a reasoned stop can remain appropriate.

CLM-0344–0366 support scoped primary context and explicit researcher design. There is no outcome prevalence, ranking, employer forecast, new participant or validated causal remedy.

## Instrument and gate

Use the existing Q006–Q013 with unaided account first, existing pre-proposal/recent-case routes and respect for unknown/non-disclosure. Source-only historical examples cannot fill the recent 24-month sample. All earlier/client/core artifacts are preserved. Complete independent integrated review and preservation checks before closing desktop work. Next R07: priorities and defensible contextual differences. Nothing is sent without user permission.
'''.replace('prepared29October2026','prepared 29 October 2026').replace('recent 24-month','recent 24-month'))
